<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
	<PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>netstandard2.1</TargetFramework>
    <Version>1.1.1.6</Version>
	<PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <RootNamespace>NarayaniInfotec.DataLite</RootNamespace>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <ApplicationIcon>Ni_Logo2.ico</ApplicationIcon>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Title>Lightweight DB-agnostic CRUD &amp; SP helper</Title>
    <Copyright>All rights are reserved</Copyright>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <AssemblyTitle>NarayaniInfotec.DataLite</AssemblyTitle>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.0.6</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>1.0.1.6</FileVersion>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>- Added support for asynchronous database operations in CRUD methods.
- Added support for asynchronous execution of stored procedures.
- Added XML documentation comments for public API surface to remove missing XML comment warnings and improve IntelliSense:
- StoredProcedures/SpParam.cs — documented Name, Value and constructor.
- CRUD/ICrudRepository.cs — documented Execute, ExecuteAsync, Query, QueryAsync, InsertAndReturnId, SelectList/SelectListAsync, QueryList/QueryListAsync and related parameters/return values.
- Extensions/DataTableExtensions.cs — documented class and ToList extension method.
- Verified solution builds successfully after changes.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Description>DataLite is a lightweight, database-agnostic CRUD utility library for .NET. It provides simple Insert, Update, Delete, and Select operations without requiring an ORM or database-specific code.</Description>
    <PackageIcon>NewNI_Logo.jpeg</PackageIcon>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/NarayaniInfotec/NI-s_LightWeight_CrudLibrary</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>Private</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>DataLite; Fastest CRUD; lightweight, database-agnostic CRUD</PackageTags>
  </PropertyGroup>
	<ItemGroup>
	  <Content Include="Ni_Logo2.ico" />
	</ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Data.SqlClient" Version="6.1.3" />
  <PackageReference Include="System.ComponentModel.Annotations" Version="5.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<None Include="..\..\..\Downloads\NewNI_Logo.jpeg">
		  <Pack>True</Pack>
		  <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
		</None>
		<None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
		<None Include="CHANGELOG.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
	</ItemGroup>
	
</Project>
